# Local settings for wrangler dev. Nothing here is needed: copy this file to
# .dev.vars, which git ignores, only if you want to set something.
#
# Cloudflare's Deploy button reads this file for the secrets to ask for, and
# shows a value given here as if it had been filled in. So the file names
# none, and that form asks for nothing.
#
# The admin secret is chosen on the admin page the first time a new
# deployment is opened. ADMIN_SECRET, when set (at least 16 characters), is
# the admin secret instead, and replaces one chosen on the page for good. On a
# deployment it is set in the Cloudflare dashboard, as the way back in when
# the secret is forgotten.
# ADMIN_SECRET=
